Function Requirement
  Feature requirement gathering follows two methods for a complex system
    USE CASE  - scenrio in which a system is used
        identify users/actors for the system
        capture and describe all possible scenerios
    USER FLOW - Geographical representation of each use case
        expand use case through flow of events
        events contain : ACTION and DATA(to and from)

Unified Modeling Languege (UML) - Sequence diagram
   interaction between actors and objects
   standard for visualising system design
   Output of the sequence diagram provides API calls details
